Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（警报声）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经被完全包围了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放弃无谓的抵抗下来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（查理）这下可糟了……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到警备这么森严。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是心园美术馆。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过心园市警{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就为了一张卡居然这么拼命啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果这张卡的力量真像传闻中那样的话……！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（明星）嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园市警的紧急呼叫。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉有独家新闻的味道～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园美术馆！果然出事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？这家伙是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（查理）哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.05,0:01:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿！一阵子没见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成漂亮女人了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久不见了，明星。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.78,0:01:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}查理！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}关你什么事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.71,0:01:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}美术馆那场骚动就是你干的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底偷了什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺敏锐的嘛～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天之内无论如何都得送到才行啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以呢，我有点头疼啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧给我去警察局！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别这么冷淡嘛～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说一马先生的摩托车，借我骑骑呗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摩托车？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还宝贝地骑着呢吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.39,0:01:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭什么借给你这种人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看在老交情的份上嘛。拜托啦～
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～还有，我肚子饿了还有吃的东西呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 别自作主张啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 这么定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}30分钟后 在车站前广场等着。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:01:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要好好化个妆再来哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 查理！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么昔日情分啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.15,0:02:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦 大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}查理。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.51,0:02:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 我绝对要揍飞他！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}状态绝佳啊 我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.27,0:02:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）等等我 游马～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 今天之内 再来一场对决！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）不可掉以轻心。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来的对手 都是存活下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强者们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过就是要跟强者对战{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才是决斗…嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你现在在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？在车站附近啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，那正好。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}车站前广场那个男的应该在那等着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帮我抓住他。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁啊？这个大叔。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很忙的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己去不就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也很忙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈～？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别废话了…快去找！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了！在我过去之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不许让他跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是姐姐的强人所难…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁啊？这个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.14,0:03:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是不听话的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉会有不得了的事情发生～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，要决斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）我是 潜行母舰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气鲨的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！空气鱼雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（空气鲨）鲨～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:03:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4000对零！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太强了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是吧～。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 鲨鱼 好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你果然参加了WDC啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是有点事而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等我达成我的目的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会从这个大会消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.81,0:04:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊那是。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全国大赛上打败我的那个对手出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……是为了把我引入陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把无关的人也给……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.11,0:04:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}？ 陷阱？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把那笔账讨回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，别跟我扯上关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜世界决斗狂欢节预选赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以心之碎片为赌注最强的决斗者们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展开激烈的战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要收集5个心之碎片{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要打进决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.06,0:06:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:07:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.捕获完毕。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼那家伙到底发生什么事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。呐 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看那边。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大叔。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我叫九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九……你……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是说让我抓住你？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是你姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这样。我也
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明正忙着决斗嘉年华呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也要参加决斗嘉年华？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那要不要和我决斗一场？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。我想试试这张卡的运气。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.05,0:08:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，那边戴帽子的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你好像是个决斗者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就和我来一场以心之碎片为赌注的决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也参加决斗嘉年华？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。不过游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不是随便哪里都有的根本见不着面{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你见识一下决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）哈特兰德先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的情况怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈特兰德先生）他的字典里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.18,0:08:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有败北这两个字。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华的参赛者中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.35,0:08:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经有超过50%被淘汰。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡正稳步
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}聚集到强大的决斗者手中。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都在我们的预料之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕来自星光体世界的使者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了向我们复仇才来到这个世界的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是那家伙的记忆在来到这个世界的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就变成了99张 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞散到了全世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:09:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那对我们来说是求之不得的机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那家伙恢复记忆之前收集卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在得到强大力量之前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把星光界毁灭掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂查理！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.31,0:09:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说为什么把我的心灵碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}擅自拿去赌啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.51,0:09:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心灵碎片被夺走了的话你打算怎么办啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦 别那么嚷嚷。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽这么说……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对面的场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是有3只超量怪兽啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底打算怎么办啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且生命值的差距是3900。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是啊 就是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想翻盘那是绝对绝对不可能的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！我真是个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值 就是 狂欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要太阳 不裂成两半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的好运就不会耗尽！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值 就是 狂欢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个人还觉得自己能赢呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:10:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 难道说真的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法 重新抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是把自己的手牌放回卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 按照放回去的数量重新抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了来了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？我搞砸了吗？我。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我都说了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 三张王牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过这个效果，手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当有3张等级1的同名卡时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将那3张特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将3只骰子机·七特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力才100？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你终于放弃决斗了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，我可是满心想着要赢呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骰子机·七 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骰子？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在搞什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命 就是 狂欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷骰子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据骰子掷出的点数提升等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全是6。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.07,0:11:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3个骰子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部掷出6的概率是 216分之1。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了 这样一来等级1的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骰子机·七 全部{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升级到等级7！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上集齐了3只等级7的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了强运之风向我吹来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级7的骰子·七
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.95,0:11:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:11:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.7幸运条纹！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他是 No.使者吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（幸运·七）幸运·七。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡 梦想骰子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是掷骰子掷出6的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手的怪兽全部攻击力变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 掷出6以外的点数的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.84,0:12:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都变成零了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.07,0:13:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是6，又是6！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中大奖～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你的怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都归零了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连续掷出6的概率是一千二百九十六分之一！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，幸运条纹！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，就算受到伤害也不过才700。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动幸运条纹的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡进行战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掷骰子！然后，这个回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力将变为掷出的点数相乘后的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是最后的收尾了接下我的运气吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来幸运条纹的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:14:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骰子掷出的点数6乘以700等于4200！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《果然和传闻一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，比传闻还厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……真是个了不起的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有这个在明天的手术也……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难以置信……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个回合就大逆转了……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实这不是能随便见到的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}何等强运……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连续掷出6的概率是七千七百七十六分之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出老千！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然一直出6。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.19,0:14:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵……哈哈哈哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}查理·麦考伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经被完全包围了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乖乖投降吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀呀 稍微绕路绕太久了点吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把双手放到头上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 好。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过啊 我应该说过吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们是抓不住我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.84,0:15:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还在我手上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被我吸走运气的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇 哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？No.卡竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！我的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，快逃。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（惨叫）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在干什么，快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊，我的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吧。我最强的运气。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我说过了吧运气会被吸走……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要小心啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值 就是 狂欢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太阳只要没被劈成两半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的运气就不会耗尽！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你姐姐来了的话帮我道个歉 拜啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还给我 你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 这是在吵什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 不在了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然都是查理害的啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来 那家伙～。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易 把摩托车和饭团
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给他带过来了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 那家伙用过的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是从美术馆偷来的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大概吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说只要持有那张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能变成运气好到离谱的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止 持有那张卡的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有的突然成了大富翁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有的突然成了顶级明星。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就像是能带来好运的卡呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.09,0:18:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个叫查理的家伙到底是什么人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是爸爸大学里的学生。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为崇拜爸爸{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就自以为是冒险家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始当什么寻宝猎人了……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是满世界到处乱跑的大笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还以为有一阵子见不到他了呢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.84,0:18:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果竟然干出这么离谱的事来……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了？游马。绝对要找到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙可是把我的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接拿走了就这么拿走了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！我们也出发吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有线索吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算盲目地找也找不到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他好几次提到过的那句话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命就是狂欢……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有印象。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}86号街 湾区？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 以前和你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起坐单轨电车的时候看到过。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值 就是 狂欢…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里 那些字 就在。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他 是不是也看到了那个呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那家伙有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然没有确证…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能去看看了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（警车警笛）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.84,0:19:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里 不是开往湾区的车站吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘客 乘务员 避难完毕！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}单轨电车 完全停止！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已包围犯人！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这列车不会动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经逃不掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园市警还真是纠缠不休啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有 这个这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可别给我忘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请再稍等一会儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.37,0:19:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，等一下，客人！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是谁，都别想挡住本大爷的去路！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}单轨列车开动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇，直升机的控制失灵了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目前，单轨列车正载着犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}驶向湾区！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……哈哈哈哈……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大姐！我找到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正坐在单轨列车上。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.84,0:20:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}单轨列车？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亏你找得到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是一马先生的儿子。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！把我的卡还回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了，冷静点。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这列单轨列车现在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}控制中心没法控制。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，它会载着我们一路直奔目的地。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？　到站之前　跟我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来场决斗吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你赢了卡就还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　把 No.卡回收过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好　决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘　设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜　设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗目标　锁定　开启！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像　连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在搞什么啊　那群笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是玩决斗的时候吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.84,0:21:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！　什么时什么时候不时机的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.84,0:21:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是　这辆单轨电车要是控制不了的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁来　踩刹车啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.84,0:21:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}问谁？那当然是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刹车？哇啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.84,0:21:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别怕啊！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值 就是 狂欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切 全看运气！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:21:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来享受决斗吧！

